{
  "abstract_summary": "evo is a plugin for agentic frameworks that optimizes code through experiments. Given a codebase, it discovers metrics to optimize, sets up the evaluation, and runs experiments in a loop using tree search over parallel semi-autonomous agents, keeping changes that improve the score and discarding those that do not.",
